Package: arrdata
Title: Simulated Data for Work-Oriented Rehabilitation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tonje", "Johnsen",
           email = "tonjejossie@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Contains a fictional dataset for learning how to
    organise, document and share data in an R package.
    The data describe simulated participants in work-oriented
    rehabilitation and do not represent real patients.
